    <briefdescription>
<para>A set of parameters to control various transforms performed by IPSCCP pass. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each of the boolean parameters can be set to: true - enabling the transformation. false - disabling the transformation. Intended use is to create a default object, modify parameters with additional setters and then pass it to IPSCCP. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
